  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior loan of up to MAD 2,200m (ca. EUR 200m equivalent) to OCP  S.A. for the construction of seawater desalination facilities to cover the  industrial needs of the Company.  The Project will lead to a significant reduction in the use of fresh water  through the construction of seawater desalination facilities for industrial use.</narrative>
